<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">二、需要布置的教室<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">家贤楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>1206-1508</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>1514</SPAN>，建功楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>2214</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>2314<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">除本班教室外，请年段指定班级进行教学楼东侧自修教室的布置</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">要求班主任要下班指导本班学生进行试场布置。</SPAN><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><FONT face=Simsun> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">三、布置的具体要求如下<SPAN lang=EN-US>:</SPAN></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>1</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">、</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>  </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">做到</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>“</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">四清</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>”<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">地面清</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">：搞好教室卫生，地上无纸屑。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">墙面清</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">：墙上所有</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">文字和图画</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">都要清除，实在难以清除的用纸覆盖，<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">覆盖要牢固、整齐</B>。覆盖的纸到教学处</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">领。软板上的帘子拉下来，</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">教室内的时钟全部摘下，放在讲台上，供监考教师参考。</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">桌面清</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">：桌面要求无任何文字（要贴标签请贴在桌子底部），挑选桌面平整的，桌脚不摇晃课桌做考试课桌。<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">桌面高度全部调整为露出</B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>3</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">个孔。</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">内里清</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">：课桌内、课桌下、椅子下清理干净。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
