<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">）余下的桌椅，放教室外靠墙，并排两列。摆放要整齐、安全。桌面上不能放东西（图</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">），凳子放在桌子下面（为使排列更紧密，凳子放在桌腿横梁上悬空，图</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>6</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">）。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">3</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">、贴好</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">桌贴。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）桌贴<SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red">4</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: red">日上午课间</SPAN>到行政二楼教学处<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>领取，备用考场不用贴桌贴。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 1.15pt; mso-para-margin-left: .11gd"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）桌贴只有数字，按上图贴在课桌的左上角。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: red; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）门贴由考务组统一贴 。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>4</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">、每班布置完成后，至少留</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>3</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">位班干部在教室，等检查验收</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><FONT face=Simsun> </FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;">。</SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;"></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "&#718;&#805;",serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201904/2019040408061616.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201904/2019040408061616.jpg" width=830 height=790> </A></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
    
